# Known Bugs

Record reproducible defects that should survive beyond the current task. States are `open`, `investigating`, `blocked`, `deferred`, and `fixed`.

For each bug include a stable ID, severity, area, symptoms, reproduction, expected/actual behavior, likely source owner, evidence, workaround, and verification path. Fix durable source rather than generated output. Move an entry to Fixed only after its focused reproduction and required Project Health gate pass; retain root cause and regression risk for future search.

No product bug was inferred during workflow installation.
